r Android, Firefox for iOS,...</span>\n            <span class=\"pencil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"updated-label\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 2/3/25\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"document-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\"><a href=\"#\">Insecure connection password warning in Firefox</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"article-summary\">Firefox will show you a \"connection is not secure\" warning message when a website login page is<br>insecure and information could be stolen.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\">\n            <span class=\"product\">Firefox</span>\n            <span class=\"pencil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"updated-label\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/19/26\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"document-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\"><a href=\"#\">Third-party trackers</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"article-summary\">Learn about cross-site (third-party) cookies that collect information to track your browsing, which are<br>used on many websites.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\">\n            <span class=\"product\">Firefox</span>\n            <span class=\"pencil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"updated-label\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 10/26/24\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"document-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\"><a href=\"#\">Does Firefox share my location with websites?</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"article-summary\">Learn what information Firefox sends to websites about your location and how to use and manage<br>location-aware features of your browser.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\">\n            <span class=\"product\">Firefox</span>\n            <span class=\"pencil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"updated-label\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/22/26\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"article\">\n          <span class=\"document-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <h3 class=\"article-title\"><a href=\"#\">Configure DNS over HTTPS protection levels in Firefox</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"article-summary\">DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is a recommended feature that enhances privacy. Learn more about the DoH<br>protection levels you can configure in Firefox settings.</p>\n          <div class=\"article-meta\">\n            <span class=\"product\">Firefox</span>\n            <span class=\"pencil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span class=\"updated-label\">Last updated:</span>&nbsp; 3/27/25\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <div class=\"partial-bottom\">\n          <article class=\"article\">\n            <span class=\"document-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <h3 class=\"article-title\"><a href=\"#\">Enhanced Tracking Protection in Firefox for desktop</a></h3>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <form class=\"search-box\">\n        <label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"support-search\">Search</label>\n        <input id=\"support-search\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search questions, arti\">\n        <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      </form>\n\n      <h2>Popular Firefox Topics</h2>\n      <ul class=\"topic-list\">\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Backup, recovery, and<br>sync</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Browse</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Performance and<br>connectivity</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Accessibility</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Download and save</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\">Search, tag, and share</a></li>\n        <li><a href=